doctype html
html(lang='en')
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    meta(name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    meta(name='csrf-token' content=csrfToken)
    title TARIC assisted classification
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/color-theme.css')
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/taric.css')
    script(src='/js/taric-admin.js' defer)
  body
    main
      nav
        a(href='/admin') Administration
      h1 TARIC assisted classification
      p A suggestion always needs human confirmation. Training-derived v0 scores diagnose the machinery; they cannot authorize release.
      p#status(role='status' aria-live='polite') Loading readiness…
      section
        h2 Readiness and release reasons
        button#refresh(type='button') Refresh
        pre#readiness
        p Read status, explicitly cancel pending work, then request recovery. Recovery acquires exclusive Gateway admission without starting GPU, holds it during the database handoff, and releases only that session with verified cleanup. Busy or uncertain recovery keeps the hold. Passive status is idle_unverified. Clearing does not resume paused runs.
        button#remote-status(type='button') Read remote status (no GPU work)
        pre#recovery-status
        label
          input#confirm-idle(type='checkbox')
          |  I authorize pending-work cancellation / exclusive admission recovery (no inference)
        button#cancel-pending(type='button') Cancel all pending local work (keep remote hold)
        button#resume(type='button') Recover hold using exclusive admission
      section
        h2 Dedicated integration credential
        p One active key, expiring after 90 days. Rotation immediately revokes the previous generation and queued authority. Store the new key in the caller’s secret store.
        button#rotate(type='button') Create / rotate key
        button#revoke(type='button') Revoke key
        div#secret-panel(hidden)
          p Copy now. This value is shown only once and clears from this page after 60 seconds.
          output#secret
          button#clear-secret(type='button') Clear key
      section
        h2 Configuration
        p Enabling permits explicitly requested test calls when v0 is imported. Normal mode still requires the current independent benchmark, approved catalog and verified runtime identity.
        label
          input#enabled(type='checkbox')
          |  Enable tool (clear for kill switch)
        label(for='max-tokens') Maximum output tokens (1–512)
        input#max-tokens(type='number' min='1' max='512' value='256')
        label(for='catalog') Approved catalog JSON (null keeps normal mode closed)
        textarea#catalog(rows='8' spellcheck='false') null
        label(for='runtime') Runtime attestations JSON; verification checks fixed Gateway metadata
        textarea#runtime(rows='8' spellcheck='false') {"adapters":[]}
        p See the runbook for catalog and runtime field schemas. Saving invalidates earlier scores.
        button#save-config(type='button') Save configuration
      section
        h2 Test a stored AmiAmi item
        p Uses the pinned untested adapter. Only an item code and caller hints are accepted; facts come from AmiAmi. This action calls the provider when the tool is enabled.
        label(for='test-code') AmiAmi gcode
        input#test-code(type='text' maxlength='64')
        label(for='test-name') Descriptive category
        input#test-name(type='text' maxlength='500')
        label(for='test-hs') HS code (six digits, optionally dotted)
        input#test-hs(type='text' maxlength='7')
        button#test(type='button') Submit manual-confirmation test
        button#test-poll(type='button') Poll test
        p Generated diagnostic text is UNVALIDATED / REJECTED and cannot be applied as an approved suggestion. A test allowlist rejection is not a legal TARIC validity judgment. Historical discarded output is not captured and cannot be recovered.
        pre#test-result
        label(for='test-selected-code') Human-selected final TARIC code (ten digits)
        input#test-selected-code(type='text' maxlength='10' pattern='[0-9]{10}')
        p Submit only after reviewing a terminal result or choosing a manual fallback. One final choice is immutable and remains unverified.
        button#test-feedback(type='button') Record final choice
        pre#test-feedback-result
      section
        h2 Benchmark import
        p CSV inputs: descriptive_name, full_item_name, specs, hs_code. Required target: taric_code. Optional description_summary is scored for lexical overlap only. Private rows stay in MongoDB; they are never added to the public catalog as official labels.
        input#csv(type='file' accept='.csv,text/csv')
        label(for='version') Version (0 is permanently training-derived)
        input#version(type='number' min='0' max='10000' value='0')
        label(for='review') Review and frozen scoring policy JSON
        textarea#review(rows='12' spellcheck='false') {"targetsReviewed":false,"independent":false,"trainingExcluded":false,"provenance":"Training-derived diagnostic benchmark","reviewer":"operator","sourceLineage":["v0"],"minExact":1,"maxInvalid":0}
        p Defaults require 100% exact codes and 0 invalid outputs. These are conservative operational thresholds, not evidence of statistical quality. Review and choose explicitly before import; policy is immutable afterward.
        button#preview(type='button') Preview hash and validation
        button#import(type='button' disabled) Import immutable draft
        pre#import-report
      section
        h2 Benchmark execution and publication
        p Drafts are inert for release. Import reviewed independent v1+ only after checking provenance and product-family overlap. Publishing explicitly replaces the current version and holds older normal results. Benchmark runs make live provider calls; run them only during an authorized GPU window.
        p Benchmarks use exclusive owned Gateway sessions in bounded batches. Each session has a 120-second idle cap and an absolute 15-minute cap; heartbeat cannot extend that cap. Batches rotate safely between completed cases.
        button#adapters(type='button') Load adapter metadata
        label(for='adapter') Adapter to benchmark
        select#adapter
        label(for='benchmark-id') Benchmark version (newest first)
        select#benchmark-id(disabled)
        p#benchmark-help Loading benchmark versions…
        button#benchmarks-more(type='button' disabled) Load more versions
        button#run(type='button' disabled) Queue adapter benchmark
        button#publish(type='button' disabled) Publish this benchmark
        label(for='run-id') Run ID to cancel / revoke
        input#run-id(type='text' maxlength='32')
        button#cancel(type='button') Cancel future cases / revoke completed run
        button#run-progress(type='button') Load progress and case outputs
        pre#run-progress-output
        p The run deadline and current session expiry are visible in private run records below. Closing this page does not cancel a run; use Cancel run to stop it. Progress persists after this page closes. Errors count against the full benchmark denominator; uncertain attempts are never silently retried. Open private results below for further pages.
        label
          input#confirm-run(type='checkbox')
          |  I authorize the next cases during the current GPU window
        button#resume-run(type='button') Resume paused run after idle recovery
      section
        h2 Private inspection
        select#kind
          option(value='requests') Requests
          option(value='feedback') Feedback
          option(value='benchmarks') Benchmark versions
          option(value='runs') Runs and scores
        button#inspect(type='button') Load first page
        button#next(type='button' disabled) Next page
        pre#records
        label(for='detail-id') Benchmark or run ID for private cases/results
        input#detail-id(type='text' maxlength='32')
        label(for='offset') Case/result offset
        input#offset(type='number' min='0' max='500' step='25' value='0')
        button#detail(type='button') Show 25 cases/results
        pre#details
